<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Cambria;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #1F497D;  --docx-lt2-color: #EEECE1;  --docx-accent1-color: #4F81BD;  --docx-accent2-color: #C0504D;  --docx-accent3-color: #9BBB59;  --docx-accent4-color: #8064A2;  --docx-accent5-color: #4BACC6;  --docx-accent6-color: #F79646;  --docx-hlink-color: #0000FF;  --docx-folhlink-color: #800080;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_2 {  margin-top: 5.00pt;  margin-bottom: 5.00pt;  text-align: left;}p.docx_2 span {  font-family: 宋体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 18.00pt;  font-size: 18.00pt;}p.docx_2 span {  font-family: 宋体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 18.00pt;  font-size: 18.00pt;}.docx table, table.docx_7 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}p.docx_3 {  margin-left: 5.00pt;  text-align: justify;}p.docx_3 span {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_3 span {  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}p.docx_4 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_4 {  text-align: justify;}p.docx_4 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}p.docx_5 {  text-align: left;}p.docx_5 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}p.docx_6 {  border-bottom: 0.75pt solid black;  text-align: center;}p.docx_6 span {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}span.docx_9 {  color: #0563C1;  text-decoration: underline;}span.docx_10 {  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_10 p {  margin-left: 5.00pt;  text-align: justify;}span.docx_10 {  font-family: Times New Roman;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_11 {  font-family: 宋体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 18.00pt;  font-size: 18.00pt;}span.docx_11 p {  margin-top: 5.00pt;  margin-bottom: 5.00pt;  text-align: left;}span.docx_11 {  font-family: 宋体;  font-weight: bold;  min-height: 18.00pt;  font-size: 18.00pt;}p.docx_12 {  text-indent: 21.00pt;  text-align: justify;}p.docx_12 span {  font-family: Calibri;  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}span.docx_13 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;}span.docx_13 {  min-height: 9.00pt;  font-size: 9.00pt;  font-family: Times New Roman;}span.docx_13 p {  text-align: justify;}</style><section class="docx"><header><p class="docx_6" style="border-bottom: 0pt solid black; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p></header><article><p style="margin-top: 7.8pt; margin-bottom: 7.8pt; min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">各学院、新生社区：</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">为进一步了解学生在校期间的学习经历、体验与收获，发现学生在学习与发展过程中的问题和需求，为学校的教育教学改革提供科学依据，切实提高本科教育教学质量，学校决定于6月24日～7月24日开展本科生学习与发展调查。现将有关事宜通知如下：</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span style="min-height: 15pt; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">一、调查主题</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24.1pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">“本科生学习与发展调查（2026年）”（简称SSLD调查）。</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span style="min-height: 15pt; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">二、调查对象</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">西安电子科技大学全日制2023级、2024级、2025级本科生</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span style="min-height: 15pt; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">三、调查方式</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; text-align: left;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">此次调查采用网上答题方式进行。调查期间，学生可PC端登录学校一站式网上办事大厅（网址：http://ehall.xidian.edu.cn/），搜索“西安电子科技大学问卷调查—本科生学习与发展调查”参与调查，或移动端通过扫描“本科生学习与发展调查”二维码（附件1）直接参与。</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span style="min-height: 15pt; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">四、工作要求</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">1.高度重视，精心组织。各学院、新生社区要高度重视，周密部署，落实责任分工，确保按时完成本项工作。</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">2.做好动员，确保质量。学校将对工作开展情况进行实时统计和评比，将完成率、达标率（有效问卷的比例）反馈各学院、新生社区。</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">此次为匿名调查，不会以任何形式公开个人信息，数据仅供学校决策和研究之用。</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">联系人：杨 磊</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">联系电话：029-81891832</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 30pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt;">邮箱：</span><span class="docx_9" style="font-size: 16px; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; min-height: 15pt;">xxfdk@xidian.edu.cn</span></span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; margin-right: 22.5pt; text-align: right;"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">学生工作处</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 宋体, SimSun; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 16px;">2026年6月24日</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-align: left; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; margin-right: 22.5pt; text-align: left;"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-family: 宋体, SimSun; font-size: 16px;">附件：1.“本科生学习与发展调查（2026）”二维码</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; margin-right: 22.5pt; text-align: left;"><br></p><p style="line-height: 1; text-indent: 24pt; margin-right: 22.5pt; text-align: center;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 15pt; position: relative; text-indent: 0px; width: 112.5pt; height: 112.5pt;"><img src="/__local/F/7D/98/D54C39AB7BAE575BACACEF176DB_096D32F0_1597.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F7D98D54C39AB7BAE575BACACEF176DB/096D32F0/1597" vheight=" 112.5pt" vwidth=" 112.5pt" orisrc="/__local/F/7D/98/D54C39AB7BAE575BACACEF176DB_096D32F0_1597.png" class="img_vsb_content" style="position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 112.5pt; height: 112.5pt;"></span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; margin-right: 22.5pt; text-align: center;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 15pt;">（扫码即可填写）</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; margin-right: 22.5pt; text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); min-height: 15pt; font-size: 15pt;"> &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: right;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 22pt; line-height: 22pt; text-indent: 24pt; text-align: right;"><br></p></article></section>
